<title>USA: PFF Bancorp gets approval for repurchase.</title>
<headline>PFF Bancorp gets approval for repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, Calif 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PFF Bancorp Inc said it received approval from the Office of Thrift Supervision to implement a program to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding common stock, or 991,875 shares.</p>
<p>The company intends to commence the stock repurchase program as soon as practicable after the public release of the company's earnings for the quarter ended December 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
